    "name": "Ch 13 - Just Enough JavaScript for Postman",
    "description": "Every JavaScript example from Chapter 13 as a runnable Postman script. Open a request, select **Send**, then open the **Console** (bottom bar) to see what `console.log` printed. Or run the whole collection with Newman. Three requests in folder 10 fail on purpose to show real error messages.\n\nNeeds the practice API running (`node server.js`) and the environment \"Practice API - Local\".",
